    "sections": {
        "description": "<h3>Form Stop Spam Emails &#8211; A permanent solution to stop spam emails</h3>\n<p>&#8220;DS CF7 Math Captcha&#8221; plugin gives functionality of prevent unwanted spam to your contact form 7. Contact Form 7 plugin is most widely used by many users so this plugin helps to prevent unwanted spam from website that has been created by Contact Form 7 plugin. This plugin is very much effective to stop form spam for Contact Form 7 plugin.</p>\n<h4>The plugin has been tested with the latest version (6.1) of Contact Form 7</h4>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Math Captcha</li>\n<li>Refresh Math Captcha</li>\n<li>Available Translations &#8211; English (US), French, Hindi</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<p>In most cases you can install plugin by single click from WordPress admin dashboard.</p>\n<p>However, if you install this manually, follow these steps:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Upload the entire <code>ds-cf7-math-captcha</code> folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"how%20i%20can%20add%20captcha%20in%20contact%20form%207%3F\">\nHow I can add captcha in contact form 7?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>To add the mathcaptcha you can find the tag &#8216;Mathcaptcha&#8217; when you will create new contact form. When you will click on &#8216;Mathcaptcha&#8217; tag then that tag shortcode will display in the form editor. That&#8217;s all!!</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>3.0.7</h4>\n<p>Fourteen Stable version</p>\n<h4>3.0.6</h4>\n<p>Thirteen Stable version</p>\n<h4>3.0.5</h4>\n<p>Twelve Stable version</p>\n<h4>3.0.4</h4>\n<p>Eleven Stable version</p>\n<h4>3.0.3</h4>\n<p>Ten Stable version</p>\n<h4>3.0.2</h4>\n<p>Nine Stable version</p>\n<h4>3.0.1</h4>\n<p>Eighth Stable version</p>\n<h4>3.0.0</h4>\n<p>Seventh Stable version</p>\n<h4>2.0.2</h4>\n<p>Sixth Stable version</p>\n<h4>2.0.1</h4>\n<p>Fifth Stable version</p>\n<h4>2.0</h4>\n<p>Fourth stable Release</p>\n<h4>1.2</h4>\n<p>Second stable Release</p>\n<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>First stable release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
